  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Aquatic resources East/Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced Capacity for Aquatic Resources in East and South Africa with a focus on fish and environmental health. The objectives of the project are to strengthen the education and research systems of partner institutions, including investment in small-scale infrastructure in order to secure an equitable gender-balanced, more competent and qualified workforce to meet the challenges of the aquacuture industry.</narrative>
  </description>
